{
  "uid": "urnetwork-extender-seed",
  "title": "urnetwork / extender seed",
  "tags": [
    "urnetwork",
    "extenders"
  ],
  "description": "The public extender seed bundle (connect/EXTENDER-UPDATE2.md §2): what the publisher stored, how fresh it is, and what every configured mirror route serves, with its sequence and expiry. Fed by the taskworker's seed chain (taskworker/work/extender_seed_metrics.go) and the api's origin (controller/extender_seed_origin.go). Alerts are the monitor's (monitor/SIGNALS.md §27.1).",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "env",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "warp-mimir"
        },
        "query": "label_values(urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_enabled, env)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "publisher",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "seed enabled",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_enabled{env=\"$env\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "1 while extender.yml enables the public seed bundle in the taskworker that ran the last pass, 0 while it is off (the default). No value: no taskworker ran the seed chain in the last 30 minutes, or the build predates it."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "published bundle age",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "time() - max(urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_published_issued_timestamp_seconds{env=\"$env\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "How long ago the bundle the origin store holds was issued. The publisher replaces it every 6 hours, or sooner when a member leaves the open pool or is revoked, so a healthy value stays under 6 hours."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "published bundle validity left",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_published_expires_timestamp_seconds{env=\"$env\"}) - time()",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "How long the stored bundle stays valid. The validity is the records' lifetime (a day unless record_lifetime_hours says otherwise), so a healthy value is at least the lifetime less 6 hours; under that, the publisher is missing its refresh, and at zero every client refuses the bundle as expired."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "records by family",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (ip_version) (urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_published_records{env=\"$env\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "ipv{{ip_version}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Records of the stored bundle with an address of each family: an IPv4-only and an IPv6-only client each need some. A dual-stack record counts in both. At most 8 records."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "revocations",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_published_revocations{env=\"$env\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Root-signed revocations the stored bundle carries: members the operator revoked, kept while a record they dominate could still be valid. At most 32."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "publisher passes by outcome (per hour)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_publishes_total{env=\"$env\"}[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Each 10-minute pass of the seed chain: published (a new bundle was stored), current (nothing was due), empty (no open record to publish; the stored bundle is kept and ages out), claimed or superseded (another pass took the sequence; the next pass goes above it), and the failures config_error, store_error, sign_error, self_check_failed (the signed bundle does not verify under root_public_keys_hex) and sequence_exhausted."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "sequence: origin and mirrors",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_published_sequence{env=\"$env\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "origin"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (mirror, route) (urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_mirror_sequence{env=\"$env\"})",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "{{mirror}} {{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The sequence of the stored bundle and of the bundle each mirror route served at its last check (a verified bundle only). Sequences only rise: a mirror's line below the origin's is a mirror behind, and any line that falls is a rollback, which clients refuse. A sequence is the issue time in unix milliseconds, raised past the last one when the clock is behind."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "mirrors",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "mirror routes up",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (mirror, route) (urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_mirror_up{env=\"$env\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{mirror}} {{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "1 when the route's last check fetched a bundle that verified under the root keys and was fresh. A route is a mirror's url resolved as usual (dns) or one configured dial address (ipv4, ipv6), dialed directly with the url's host as the TLS server name: the DNS-independent route a client takes. Mirrors are labeled by their configured name, never an address."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "mirror lag behind the origin",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "scalar(max(urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_published_issued_timestamp_seconds{env=\"$env\"})) - max by (mirror, route) (urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_mirror_issued_timestamp_seconds{env=\"$env\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{mirror}} {{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "How much older the bundle a mirror route serves is than the one the origin store holds. Mirrors copy the origin every few minutes, so a healthy route is at 0 within minutes of each publish; a route that stays behind past an hour is stale. Negative is a mirror ahead of the origin: the origin rolled back."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "mirror validity left",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (mirror, route) (urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_mirror_expires_timestamp_seconds{env=\"$env\"}) - time()",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{mirror}} {{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "How long the bundle each mirror route serves stays valid. A client refuses an expired bundle (with a 5-minute clock allowance), so a route near zero is about to stop bootstrapping anyone."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "mirror checks by outcome (per hour)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (mirror, route, outcome) (increase(urnetwork_taskworker_extender_seed_mirror_checks_total{env=\"$env\"}[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{mirror}} {{route}} {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Every mirror route check by outcome: ok, the fetch failures unreachable, tls (the certificate does not verify for the url's host), redirect (a first-party mirror never redirects), http_status and too_large, and the verification refusals of connect.VerifyExtenderSeed (malformed, signature, foreign_network, record_invalid, gated_record, expired, not_yet_valid and the rest)."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "origin answers at /v1/seed.bin (per hour)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "warp-mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(urnetwork_extender_seed_origin_responses_total{env=\"$env\"}[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The api's answers at the seed path, the origin every mirror copies: served, not_modified (a conditional request for the current bundle), disabled (the seed is off: 404), absent (nothing stored: 404) and unavailable (no stored bundle verifies, or the store cannot be read past the last good copy: 503)."
    }
  ]
}
